{'symbol': 'PARA', 'date': '2023-05-08 18:30:00', 'title': 'PARAMOUNT GLOBAL DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PARAMOUNT GLOBAL (NASDAQ: PARA, PARAA) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.05 PER SHARE ON BOTH ITS CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON JULY 3, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2023.'}